# ${project_name}

${project_description}

Terragrunt live config consumed by Atlantis on every PR. Generated from
`tmpl/` + `blueprints/` + `configs/` via `boilerplate` — do NOT
hand-edit `infra-live/`.

## Layout

```
root.hcl                    # terragrunt root config
common.hcl                  # shared inputs / remote_state config
infra-live/                 # GENERATED — terragrunt projects
tmpl/                       # boilerplate template sources
blueprints/                 # boilerplate blueprints
configs/                    # boilerplate var files
atlantis.yaml               # GENERATED — regenerate via terragrunt-atlantis-config
```

## Workflow

1. Edit `tmpl/` / `blueprints/` / `configs/`.
2. Regenerate `infra-live/` via `just bp run <blueprint> <var-file>`.
3. Regenerate `atlantis.yaml`:
   ```
   terragrunt-atlantis-config generate \
     --root . --filter infra-live \
     --workflow terragrunt --autoplan --parallel \
     --create-project-name --output atlantis.yaml
   ```
4. Commit + open PR. Atlantis posts plan comment.
5. Review + `atlantis apply` + merge.

